# syntek-base only — this file is copier-excluded, so a generated project never receives it.
#
# A questionnaire is addressed to a named outsider — a client, a data controller, a vendor — and
# records an answer only they hold. One written while developing the TEMPLATE has no such
# recipient: it is a test that `/to-questionnaire` renders, and shipping it would put a
# half-finished document about nobody into every generated project.
#
# A generated project's questionnaires are the evidence behind decisions taken on someone else's
# word, and are committed for exactly that reason — see questionnaires/CONTEXT.md. That is why
# this rule must not travel.
#
# The documentation pair stays tracked so the folder ships documented and ready to use.
*

# This file must stay tracked or the rule vanishes on a fresh clone, and copier.yml
# can only exclude a file the template actually carries.
!.gitignore
!*/
!CONTEXT.md
!CLAUDE.md
